            "review_title": "Review at River View Restaurant And Coffee",
            "review_text": "kevinmulqueen\nNui Thanh, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nExcellent Arabic food!\nApr 2021\nI had lunch here today for the first time. The owner came out to greet us - a very friendly chap from Upper Egypt. \nWe ordered a range of vegetarian dishes, all of which were tasty: babaganoush, humus, felafel, okra and beans. Together with Arabic bread.\nAn excellent meal and cheap too: 370,000 VND for everything.\nThe only downside was the pong from the adjacent river, so perhaps sitting inside is advisable.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 4, 2021",
            "rating": 5.0,
