            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_6",
            "review_title": "Review at River View Restaurant And Coffee",
            "review_text": "MrG_Saigon\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nSweet food is not what we expected!\nApr 2020\nThe food was sweet, like cooked with sugar. Not only one dish, but 3 of the 6 dishes we ordered (shrimp egg drop soup + tikka beef banh mi + fried rice beef). And the shrimp egg drop soup was not just a little bit sweet, but as sweet as the popular Vietnamese dessert called \"sweet soup\" that is basically made of liquid sugar. The kafta was not sweet, but tasteless compared to some other restaurants. \nNote: this was a delivery.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 19, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
