            "review_title": "Review at River View Restaurant And Coffee",
            "review_text": "Brian L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam268 contributions\n0\nReally great falafel\nDec 2019\nOrdered some food for delivery and the falafel was exactly as I expected. Could have been cooked a little more crispy, but flavor and expectations were spot on. This I cannot say about the hummus!\nThe order was nothing like the expectations from the picture and the actual dish itself was not what I know as hummus. It seems like it was made without lemon, garlic & seasoning and the tahini was replaced with cream. So, although it was really smooth it didn't have any resemblance with the internationally known dish and tasted actually of very thin chick pea puree with cream.\nWhen ordering food from River View it does not come with pita bread so you must ensure you place this in your shopping basket for delivery\nThe pricing of the dishes are very reasonable and, if they can fix the hummus I think I would try this again!\nRead more\nValue\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 8, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
